		"description": "<p>Berserkers don’t disappear as technology advances, though they often become stymied by cultures and societies that demand they repress the anger and rage they are so well known for. But for some there is another path.</p><p>Shock Troopers are primarily used by military and police organizations for rapid assaults that enemies don’t have time to prepare for. With heavy weapons, heavy armor, and surprising speed, shock troopers kick down doors and shut down opposition, acting as a brute squad in modern and futuristic settings.</p><p><strong>Table: Shock Trooper</strong></p><table border=\"1\"><colgroup><col><col></colgroup><thead><tr style=\"text-align: center;\"><td>Level</td><td>Features</td></tr></thead><tbody><tr style=\"text-align: center;\"><td>3rd</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.Mf5q1PKNKvIff7SP]{Shock Training} @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.chNg7pjbZboLl5PE]{Special Weapons and Tactics}</td></tr><tr style=\"text-align: center;\"><td>6th</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.7iT2Ft9AcbtpSxSr]{Overcome}</td></tr><tr style=\"text-align: center;\"><td>10th</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.FxF6OosXc3ePDglW]{Overwhelm}</td></tr><tr style=\"text-align: center;\"><td>14th</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.zRa00wWdnpX6wstA]{Breach and Clear}</td></tr></tbody></table>",
